# Build output. Each of the five trees keeps its own root and its own .gitignore
# saying what lands there; these patterns are unanchored so they hold at every
# depth, which is what makes them survive a tree being moved.
#
#   <Tree>\out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\            exes + staged runtime DLLs
#   <Tree>\out\<Platform>\<Configuration>\obj\<Proj>\ intermediates
#
# Pinned per tree: in each .vcxproj in DirectExamples, in common\*.props in
# ComExamples and FacadeExamples, and in build.ps1 in dotNetExamples and
# PanamaJavaExamples. The last of those also stages native DLLs into bin\, which
# its OWN .gitignore covers -- deliberately not repeated here, because `bin/`
# unanchored at the root would swallow any directory of that name anywhere.
out/

logs/
.vs/
*.user
